                                "sense_id": "e41a8764-aa74-35dd-84b0-1d676d02f0ce",
                                "text": "Joan was adaptable, and easily fell in with the prevalent tone. She played her small jokes on each, and this readily dissolved restraint, and put all on terms of easy friendship."
